<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Pietro I Candiano</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">d. 887</span> · <a href="/centuries/9th-century">9th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Pietro I Candiano was Doge of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/venice">Venice</a> for a few months in 887, the first of the Candiano family to hold the office, which his descendants would dominate in the 10th century. He led a naval expedition against the Narentine <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/piracy">pirates</a> of the eastern Adriatic and was killed in battle with them on the Dalmatian coast in 887.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/pietro-i-candiano.jpg" alt="Pietro I Candiano" width="320" height="321" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Unknown authorUnknown author · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pietro_I_Candiano_(series_by_Domenico_Tintoretto_-_Doge%E2%80%99s_Palace).jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
